sec 7.4/12.6: a stranger anchors the new ledger's succession before the cut; that record is an old record, the root has no retirement in the new segment, its record of the genesis at T+3 counts and nothing is DISCARDED there; the old segment lists the succession MALFORMED and discards the stranger's record, so nothing is MISSING. The zikaron/2 succession, failing zikaron/1 sec 4.3, is no handing off under zikaron/1.
